{"955010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ARCHWIZARD", "steam_appid": 955010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARCH WIZARD is a fast paced First Person &quot;Hyper Shooter&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight battlefields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few very distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tricks in your sleeve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot mechanics to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend all your moves, skills and abilities into one personalized flow of magic rage. A calculated ever adapting dance between enemies. Using their attacks and even detached body parts to dig into the depths of combat spell craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a powerful mage. Lost in the ruins of warp portal network, once connecting the outskirts of the multiverse.<br>You must fight your way through cosmoses.<br>First — to get back to your Tower.<br>Second — to establish dominance on the parallel realms.<br>To go back from THE OTHER SIDE.<br>To find the source of Chaos.<br>To face the End of the World<br>To become the eternal ARCH WIZARD — an architect, a director, a tailor of your own fait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge based progression.  Full of secrets.<br><br>Trailer music contains tracks: Shadows And Dust by <i><strong>Scott Buckley </strong></i>and Creepy Dark Atmosphere by <i><strong>Universfield</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARCH WIZARD is a fast paced First Person &quot;Hyper Shooter&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight battlefields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few very distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tricks in your sleeve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph